### 🥰 Feature Description

### Support custom input/output configuration for custom models (including new open platform models), cache price statistics, and currency customization

- Support the input and output configuration function for custom models (including new models on open platforms);
- Support price statistics for cached input and output content;
- Provide options for custom currency settings for prices;
- Add the configuration capability of [Free] label for models. Cherry Studio implements this function by naming the model title, and LobeHub can design an independent configuration method.

<img width="1231" height="269" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9620a962-14a9-4e0f-8c38-4c629fa8ccc2" />

<img width="637" height="703" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8abea240-4922-466f-858c-47dac9123470" />

### 🧐 Proposed Solution

- Add a configuration area in the model management module to support the configuration of input and output rules for custom models;
- Configure the price calculation logic for cached input and output (e.g., by token count, number of calls, etc.) in this area;
- Add a multi-currency selection entry to support switching between mainstream international currencies;
- Add an independent "Free Label" switch/option, which does not rely on model title naming to achieve differentiated design;
- The overall function benchmarks the user experience of Cherry Studio to ensure a concise and intuitive configuration process.

### 📝 Additional Information

